&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 112%; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Amounts included in the capital lease balance sheet accounts that relate to operating leases are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 119%; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
